<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 9-0 V AUSTRALIA - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 9-0 V AUSTRALIA - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>LEEDS, England 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were  9-0 against Australia at lunch on the rain-hit first morning of the fourth Ashes test at Headingley on Thursday.</p>
